        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Render Summary"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RENDER_SUMMARY",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1770167543810",
          "id": "1770148772377",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770148772379_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Inputs\n- Skills (pre-fetched, sorted by DevelopingCount desc):\n  <skills>{{$context.$nodes.GET_SKILLS_SORTED_BY_DEVELOPING_COUNT.$output.items}}</skills>\n- Skills to include (array of skill names; empty means none to report):\n  <keepNames>{{$context.$variables.developingSkillsNames}}</keepNames>\n- Current date/time (ISO 8601; for timestamping only):\n  <now>{{$context.$system.$currentDateTime}}</now>\n\nInstructions\n- If keepNames is empty (length = 0), output exactly: No active skill development\n- Otherwise:\n  1) Treat keepNames as an array of exact SkillName strings (case-sensitive). Ignore non-string entries.\n  2) From skills, keep only items whose SkillName is in keepNames, preserving input order. Truncate to 10.\n  3) Output one short sentence, no labels:\n     - Format: \"{N} skills in active development. Top: <SkillName> (Dev <DevelopingCount>, Ach <AchievedCount>). Updated <YYYY-MM-DD>\"\n       - N = number of kept items after truncation.\n       - Top refers to the first kept item.\n       - Use <now> to render YYYY-MM-DD."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false,
              "customNotes": "Role\nYou are generating a manager-facing panel consisting of:\n1) A concise, telling panel-level title summarizing team skill development activity.\n2) A subtitle describing the top skill by DevelopingCount, if it exists.\n3) A MultiRecordWidget table that shows per-skill aggregates for the managers team.\n\nRendering constraints\n- Consume the final, filtered, and sorted results produced by the prior generic step:\n  <skills>{{$context.$nodes.GET_SKILLS_SORTED_BY_DEVELOPING_COUNT.$output.items}}</skills>\n  <keepNames>{{$context.$variables.developingSkillsNames}}</keepNames>\n- Do not re-query, re-filter, or re-sort beyond what is specified below.\n- Produce exactly one panel-level title and one subtitle before the table.\n- Keep both lines concise and decision-oriented; no extra prose before/after.\n- Then output only the multiRecordWidget JSON payload for the table.\n\nPerformance-oriented selection\n- If keepNames is an empty array (length = 0), there are no developing skills to display:\n  - displayedRows = []\n- Else:\n  - Treat keepNames as an array of exact SkillName strings (case-sensitive). Ignore any non-string entries.\n  - displayedRows = the subset of skills from <skills> whose SkillName is in keepNames, preserving the incoming order.\n  - Do not re-sort; preserve the order provided by <skills>.\n- Truncate displayedRows to at most 10 entries.\n\nPanel title and subtitle\n- If displayedRows.length == 0:\n  - Title: No active skill development\n  - Subtitle: All clear at this time  Updated <YYYY-MM-DD>\n- Else:\n  - Title: {displayedRows.length} skills actively being developed\n  - Subtitle:\n    - Let top = displayedRows[0].\n    - Top skill: <top.SkillName>  Developing <top.DevelopingCount>, Achieved <top.AchievedCount>  Updated <YYYY-MM-DD>\n- Use {{$context.$system.$currentDateTime}} for the date (YYYY-MM-DD).\n\nTable construction (MultiRecordWidget)\n- multiRecordWidget:\n  - cols: [\"Skill\", \"Developing\", \"Achieved\", \"Progress\"]\n- For each row in displayedRows:\n  - Skill: text = SkillName (preserve exactly)\n  - Developing: String(DevelopingCount)\n  - Achieved: String(AchievedCount)\n  - Progress:\n    - If progressPercent was already computed upstream, use it directly as String(progressPercent) + \"%\".\n    - Otherwise:\n      - TotalCount = (TotalCount if present) else AchievedCount + DevelopingCount\n      - If TotalCount > 0: percent = floor(100 * AchievedCount / TotalCount) else 0\n      - text = String(percent) + \"%\"\n    - Badge:\n      - If AchievedCount == 0 AND DevelopingCount > 0:\n        - priority \"warning\", badgeText \"No Completions\"\n\nPrivacy and formatting\n- Preserve SkillName exactly; do not add PII.\n- Do not fabricate fields; only use available inputs.\n\nEdge cases\n- Skip records with missing SkillName.\n- Treat missing AchievedCount as 0.\n- If DevelopingCount is missing or 0, the record should not appear via keepNames; if encountered, skip.\n- Do not display TotalCount as a column.\n\nNotes\n- Ensure the output order is: title line, subtitle line, then only the multiRecordWidget JSON payload.\n- Keep strings succinct and manager-friendly."
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Render Developing Skills"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RENDER_DEVELOPING_SKILLS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1770148039848",
          "id": "1769726891504",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769726891506_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate a list of skills being most developed by manager team given the inputs below.\nInputs\n- Skills being developed (authoritative; aggregated per skill):\n  <skills>{{$context.$nodes.GET_SKILLS_SORTED_BY_DEVELOPING_COUNT.$output.items}}</skills>\n  Each item may include:\n  - SkillName (string)\n  - SkillId (number/string)\n  - AchievedCount (number)\n  - DevelopingCount (number)\n  - TotalCount (number)\n- Names of skills to keep (array of skill names; empty array means none to report):\n  <developing_skill_names>{{$context.$variables.developingSkillsNames}}</developing_skill_names>\n- Current date/time (ISO 8601; for timestamping only):\n  <now>{{$context.$system.$currentDateTime}}</now>\n\nFiltering and ordering rules\n- If <developing_skill_names> is an empty array (length = 0), treat as no developing skills: produce an empty result set.\n- Otherwise, build keepList from <developing_skill_names>:\n  - Include only entries that are strings with length > 0; preserve case and whitespace as provided.\n- Include only skills whose SkillName exactly matches one of the names in keepList (case-sensitive exact match).\n- Do not include any other skills, even if DevelopingCount > 0 in the raw input.\n- Sort the included skills by:\n  1) DevelopingCount (descending),\n  2) then AchievedCount (descending),\n  3) then SkillName (alphabetical ascending).\n- Limit to at most 10 skills after sorting."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "dataPipeline": {
              "pipelineNodes": [
